  [
    id 18
    label "utoST3q9G8Q"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-24T12:29:25Z"
    title "Desperate Dad Drove 1,000 Miles for Baby Formula"
    description "Mac Jaehnert was on a mission to find Neosure for his daughter Mackenzie. The nutrient-rich formula is important for the little girl, who was born three-months premature. The desperate dad put 1,000 miles on his car, driving from one city to the next in Washington state. He recorded every step of the way in a video diary, which revealed his growing anxiety. During his search, he found just two cans of formula; a good Samaritan who saw his plight online gave him two more."
