    step 0
    date "2022-05-15T02:15:02Z"
    title "Baby formula shortage in US becoming crisis for parents"
    description "Supply chain slowdowns and product recalls are creating a crisis for parents across the U.S. as they struggle to find baby formula.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Across America, store shelves selling the product are going bare, with about 45 per cent in the country out of stock due to a key producer, Abbott Nutrition, recalling several brands and closing its Michigan plant.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;U.S. President Joe Biden is demanding manufacturers immediately increase production, but as Jennifer Johnson reports, doctors are warning even a temporary shortage could have long-term consequences.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more info, please go to https://globalnews.ca/news/8834325/united-states-milk-banks-surge-baby-formula-shortage/&amp;#10;Subscribe to Global News Channel HERE: http://bit.ly/20fcXDc&amp;#10;Like Global News on Facebook HERE: http://bit.ly/255GMJQ&amp;#10;Follow Global News on Twitter HERE: http://bit.ly/1Toz8mt&amp;#10;Follow Global News on Instagram HERE: https://bit.ly/2QZaZIB&amp;#10;#GlobalNews"
