    step 0
    date "2020-02-19T23:02:36Z"
    title "Mom Calls 911 Desperate for Baby Formula"
    description "For Utah police officer Brett Wagstaff, a recent 911 call was unlike any he had ever gotten before: a frantic woman was up in the middle of the night with a crying baby, but had no way to feed her. Video taken from Wagstaff's body cam shows him arriving at the home of Shannon Bird with a gallon of milk in tow. The dilemma started when the mother of five's breast milk suddenly ran dry as she attempted to pump for her hungry baby. #InsideEdition"
