    step 0
    date "2022-05-24T02:45:00Z"
    title "US military brings in baby formula from Europe amid crisis"
    description "As many American families struggle with a nationwide baby formula shortage, the military has now brought in 78,000 pounds (or 35 metric tonnes) of the highly sought-after product from Europe. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The first planeload carrying hypoallergenic baby formula arrived on Sunday in Indianapolis, delivered by the U.S. military. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The remarkable airlift will bring 1.5 million bottles of specialized formula to hospitals and doctors' offices, at a time when supplies are perilously low for the country. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jackson Proskow explains what set off the crisis, and the emotional toll it's taking on parents.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more info, please go to https://globalnews.ca/news/8863987/baby-formula-shortage-in-canada-leads-to-panic-buying/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to Global News Channel HERE: http://bit.ly/20fcXDc&amp;#10;Like Global News on Facebook HERE: http://bit.ly/255GMJQ&amp;#10;Follow Global News on Twitter HERE: http://bit.ly/1Toz8mt&amp;#10;Follow Global News on Instagram HERE: https://bit.ly/2QZaZIB&amp;#10;#GlobalNews #Formula #US"
