    id 400
    label "6YIuFBGB2RY"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-13T14:21:57Z"
    title "Why the US is Facing Baby Formula Shortage?"
    description "The crises started last year as the COVID-19 pandemic led to labour, transportation and raw materials disruptions -economy-wide concerns that didn't spare the formula industry. Inventory was additionally squeezed by parents stockpiling during COVID-19 lockdowns. On June 17, Vice President Harris travelled to Dulles International Airport to declare the arrival of over 14,000 pounds of Kendamil baby formula, equivalent to more than 200,000 8-ounce bottles of formula that are used to add more supply to shelves.&amp;#10;&amp;#10; #babyformulashortage #babyformulashortageinus  #Kendamilbabyformula #uspresident #kamalaharris #kalkinemedia &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kalkine TV is a one-stop solution to all the market-related nuances. The streaming platform offers in-depth and latest information on share market, commodities, crypto charter and economic developments. Kalkine TV leverages the expertise of in-house sector specialists, fundamental analysts and technical experts to touch base on hot trends driving the market charter and volatility. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;So, do tune in to Kalkine TV daily to catch live talk shows, market beats, and sector analysis.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;To get more updates about Australia, NZ, UK, Canada and US stock market news, investors education &amp;#38; insights, subscribe our channel at https://bit.ly/3cHKioy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our media Website &amp;#128073; https://kalkinemedia.com/us&amp;#10;Follow us and stay updated on the Go with the Market Charter &amp;#128071;&amp;#128071;&amp;#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/kalkineus/&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/KalkineUSA&amp;#10;LinkedIn - https://www.linkedin.com/company/kalkine-media-usa/"
    channeltitle "Kalkine Media"
