    title "Whats Really Behind The Baby Formula Shortage?"
    description "The real story behind the baby formula shortage is corporate greed. Abbott makes 43% of all formula. Its factory was shut down because it gamed safety tests &amp;#38; skipped repairs to cut costs. Instead, it spent ~$10 billion on dividends for wealthy shareholders since 2019.&amp;#10;-----&amp;#10;More Perfect Union is a new nonprofit media org with a mission to empower working people. Learn more here: http://perfectunion.us/&amp;#10;Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/MorePerfectUS&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/perfectunion/&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/MorePerfUnion"
