    title "How I Make Baby Formula for the Day  | 24 Hours | First Time Mum UK"
    description "How I Make Baby Formula for the Day &amp;#127868; | 24 Hours | First Time Mum UK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hi guys,&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I just wanted to share how I make formula for my baby over a 24 hour period. We use the Cow &amp;#38; Gate milk powder and the Tommee Tippee Anti-Colic bottles. I batch make the ones for during the day and then use the Tommee Tippee Prep Machine for the night. This is just what works really well for us so I wanted to share.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please like, share and subscribe to help support my channel and I hope you like these kind of videos :).&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you have any questions, please comment below and I will try my best to reply as soon as I can. Thank you for watching and stay safe!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Need help with your UK Spouse Visa application? I am now offering my services. Visit my website: www.ruksana-ahmed.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MY VIDEO PLAYLISTS&amp;#10;Spouse Extension Visa 2021 Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL11FO2uPi8C5gxkxqbOVaMXow5ZGvZnEu&amp;#10;Spouse Visa 2018 Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL11FO2uPi8C7DylXfaGpC4bmEXiV18ZcZ&amp;#10;Spouse Visa Walkthrough Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL11FO2uPi8C7Mnjnm22EPPAp0ivzAv3-M&amp;#10;Spouse Visa Q&amp;#38;A Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL11FO2uPi8C4NjtbBlEroZ3lbXU2NBOku&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DONATE: https://www.paypal.me/RuksanaA?locale.x=en_GB&amp;#10;Email: ruksana-ahmed@hotmail.co.uk (business &amp;#38; collaborations only, please comment below for any visa related queries)"
