    title "DYI PLANT BASED ALKALINE BABY FORMULA, SEA MOSS, IRON, VITAMIN D, E, K, DHA, CALCIUM, PREBIOTICS?"
    description "Plant-Based Complete Nutrition Alkaline Drink for Toddlers, 22 Oz.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CLICK LINK TO ORDER: https://readmesllc.com/alkaline%20baby%20formula%20nutrition%20drink%2022%20oz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10; Dairy-Free, Soy-Free, Corn-Syrup Free, Gluten-Free, Non-GMO, Whole plants&amp;#10;&amp;#10; Vegan, Organic, Plant-Based&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Chemical Processing&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Hexane or Solvent Extraction Methods&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Highly Processed Ingredients&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Corn Syrup Solids&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Dairy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Whey&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Soy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Palm Oil&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10060; No Tree Nuts&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10; Parents are looking for healthy options. More nutritional density without the worry of high levels of heavy metals, pesticides, and plastic. For many mom's, breastfeeding is not an option, maybe for health reasons or by choice. Either way, the formula shortage has put parents on edge, unsure of how they are going to feed their growing babies.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We believe breast milk is the best nutritional choice for infants, which is why we support the World Health Organization (WHO) recommendations and goal of increasing breast-feeding rates.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;While this is more common in premature infants, the fact remains human milk is easier to digest than alternatives such as dairy (cow/goat) or soy. It also contains substances that help fight infections and help intestinal cells mature. The DHA found in breast milk has properties that support healthy eyesight, brain development and growth as well. Finding a formula that mimics the benefits of human milk and has few long term risks, like digestive function, allergies, and immunity, is not easy, but it is not impossible either.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We also support the rights of parents to make their own informed decisions on the most appropriate way to feed their babies, and our mission is to enhance quality of life for all families with the cleanest, healthiest plant-based alternative to dairy and soy-based nutrition, made of 3 core natural, minimally-processed &amp;#38; whole food ingredients.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our formula is a great alternative to cow&amp;#8217;s milk and soy formulas that gives you a better, healthier option over dairy. Made with 100% minimally processed, whole-food ingredients. The iron, protein and natural Omega fatty acids support healthy weight gain, improved gastro-intestinal functions and a lowered risk of diarrhea, anemia, and food allergies.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Al-Cai-Line Baby LLC Formula Omega is our first Toddler product to contain Sea Moss + added Omega 3 and Omega 6 fatty acids that support brain development, and is designed to optimize essential proteins, making it complete and balanced.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;COMPLETE nutrition means it contains all macronutrients and more than 92 essential vitamins and minerals.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Remember: we wouldn't offer you anything we haven't given our own baby!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You'll add sea moss to our formula for an additional 92 minerals, along with dates for sweetness and your non-dairy milk of choice before blending (we love and recommend Hemp Milk!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;At least two tablespoons of sea moss gel or 2 sea moss infused gummies should do the trick. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HOW TO GET PICKY EATERS TO TRY SEA MOSS? &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Although sea moss is advantageous and safe, it can be quite the challenge to get your kids to eat it. Children that are picky eaters can&amp;#8217;t bring themselves to eat sea moss because of its appearance and smell, which means you&amp;#8217;ll have to improvise during food preparation. Here are a few of our suggestions:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Incorporate Into Sauces: Like other vegetables, sea moss can be disguised in different stews and soups, making it less detectable for your kid. Cooking with sea moss would also mean that you have control of how much your kids will consume.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Make A Smoothie: If your child isn&amp;#8217;t too keen on having sea moss in their sauces, they may enjoy it a little more with beverages. Blend together your sea moss with some fresh fruits, and it&amp;#8217;s sure to be sweeter and more irresistible!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Check Out Our Gummies: When you&amp;#8217;re looking for a way to make your kids eat sea moss without the effort in preparation, consider getting a jar of sea moss gummies. It&amp;#8217;s a hassle-free treat that you can give them once a day and can be a great option when you and the kids are constantly on the go.&amp;#10;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONCLUSION:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In summary, sea moss is generally safe for children to consume. It provides a multitude of benefits that can help strengthen kids from a young age, making it a delicious and healthy addition for parents when meal-planning for the family.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DISCLAIMER: Statements regarding dietary supplements have not been evaluated by the FDA and are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or health condition."
